# Tracked exceptions: self-built PST/busbar-link warmup case (no external
# license) and its standard well-behaved measurement set, and the synthetic
# cases sp_case9/118/300/1354 (generated by the project's case
# generator, not shipped; no external license) that replace the downloaded
# MATPOWER cases in workshops and tests
!data/mpower/warmup_casePST.m
!data/mpower/warmup_casePST.measurements.csv
!data/mpower/sp_case118.m
!data/mpower/sp_case9.m
!data/mpower/sp_case300.m
!data/mpower/sp_case1354.m

